    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate 1980s where North Korea won their war, Brooklyn lies in ruins. The streets are controlled by the Vires syndicate, operating under the fa\u00e7ade of Vires Corporations. As a former detective whose brother was murdered while investigating Vires Corporations, you've made a fatal choice: injecting yourself with <strong>SPIKE</strong>, a deadly military-grade stimulant that grants superhuman abilities at the cost of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 MASTER SUPERNATURAL MOVEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and slide  as you tear through urban battlegrounds. Your enhanced abilities make you unstoppable - if you can stay alive long enough to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 EXPLORE A FRACTURED CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit corporate towers to abandoned subway tunnels, every corner of this alternate Brooklyn tells a story of war, corruption, and resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 UNLEASH YOUR ARSENAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an array of classic and experimental weapons, or use your bare fists to pummel your way through thug after thug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 UNCOVER THE TRUTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With guidance from a mysterious pyramid-shaped entity, dive deep into a conspiracy that blurs the lines between victim and villain, justice and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 WISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see here, please feel free to WISHLIST now, Thanks so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an alternate 1980s where North Korea won their war, Brooklyn lies in ruins. The streets are controlled by the Vires syndicate, operating under the fa\u00e7ade of Vires Corporations. As a former detective whose brother was murdered while investigating Vires Corporations, you've made a fatal choice: injecting yourself with <strong>SPIKE</strong>, a deadly military-grade stimulant that grants superhuman abilities at the cost of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/45ed17b60a27d31c9fb7cae1c62fa6e3.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 MASTER SUPERNATURAL MOVEMENT</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and slide  as you tear through urban battlegrounds. Your enhanced abilities make you unstoppable - if you can stay alive long enough to use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 EXPLORE A FRACTURED CITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From neon-lit corporate towers to abandoned subway tunnels, every corner of this alternate Brooklyn tells a story of war, corruption, and resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/eb880bac2bccd2f292b89e067870c7c1.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 UNLEASH YOUR ARSENAL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an array of classic and experimental weapons, or use your bare fists to pummel your way through thug after thug.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 UNCOVER THE TRUTH</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With guidance from a mysterious pyramid-shaped entity, dive deep into a conspiracy that blurs the lines between victim and villain, justice and revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.poster.avif?t=1753571705\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.webm?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339570/extras/febebd15f7ac33782ee7aa72dde586d2.mp4?t=1753571705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 WISHLIST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like what you see here, please feel free to WISHLIST now, Thanks so much!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
